<title>USA: ALPINE SKIING-FRITZ STROBLE WINS LAST MENS' WORLD CUP DOWNHILL.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-FRITZ STROBLE WINS LAST MENS' WORLD CUP DOWNHILL.</headline>
<dateline>VAIL, Colorado 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fritz Strobl of Austria won the men's downhill at the World Cup Finals on Wednesday, according to provisional results.  </p>
<p>Kristian Ghedina of Italy finished second and Hannes Trinkl of Austria was third.</p>
</text>
